00:12:40.292 --> 00:12:42.962
The one piece Netflix showrunner,
the producers, pretty much

00:12:42.962 --> 00:12:46.332
the entire cast
are all such super fans of the one piece.

00:12:46.599 --> 00:12:49.201
I don't think they're going to do that
for the Netflix series.

00:12:49.201 --> 00:12:51.637
I think that they'll work out
something with Oda,

00:12:51.637 --> 00:12:54.140
let me know in the comments
if they do have to end the show

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:57.710
before Oda ends the manga,
how do you want them to end the show?

00:12:57.943 --> 00:12:58.911
post all your season

00:12:58.911 --> 00:13:01.947
two predictions in the comments
and I'll do more one pieces in two videos

00:13:01.947 --> 00:13:04.583
when they release more information
or an official season two teaser.

00:13:04.583 --> 00:13:05.818
But they're probably not going to do that.

00:13:05.818 --> 00:13:08.921
At least Netflix wouldn't announce it
until after the strike is done.

